OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'planned paint protest at
OL,4,AJohnson wedding party'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn alleged activist planned to spray
OL,7,Fthe word "Palestine" on a lawn at Boris
OL,8,FJohnson's wedding party venue, a court
OL,9,Fhas heard.
OL,11,FJurors at Southwark Crown Court were
OL,12,Ftold police approached Tim Speers, 41,
OL,13,Fat a Cotswold estate as they thought he
OL,14,Flooked "quite out of place". The former
OL,15,Fprime minister was due to celebrate his
OL,16,Fmarriage to Carrie Johnson at the
OL,17,FGloucestershire site the following day.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
