OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'planned paint protest at
OL,4,AJohnson wedding party'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the opening of Speers' trial,
OL,7,Fthe jury was told police found Speers
OL,8,Fand another man - who is due to face
OL,9,Ftrial at a later date - were carrying
OL,10,Fspray paint and super glue.
OL,12,FSpeers, of Fairfield Road in Bude,
OL,13,FCornwall, denies having items with
OL,14,Fintent to damage property. The trial
OL,15,Fcontinues.
